Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A brand new day has dawned
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.93,0:26:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, lay hee! It's time to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Over all the hills and even through the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.02,0:26:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a deep breath and relax
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.24,0:26:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Give all your worries the flick
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,(Gently, softly)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.54,0:26:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and leave them out to air atop a tree
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.25,0:26:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and bid them goodbye, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.42,0:26:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lively, energetic and full of life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.96,0:26:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy as happy can be, we sing gently with a ho ho ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.55,0:26:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And friendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,as close as two friends can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.59,0:26:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So come join this song, lay hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.52,0:27:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little goat! (Baa baa baa) Hey little bird! (Tweet tweet tweet)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.81,0:27:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume change!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.39,0:27:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little pig! (oink oink oink) Hey, horses and cows! (Neigh, moo)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.94,0:27:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little frog! (Ribbit ribbit) Hey little duck! (quack quack)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.53,0:27:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And hello to you, too! (heigh ho!) Come join us, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.11,0:27:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lively, energetic and full of life
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.57,0:27:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy as happy can be, we sing gently with a ho ho ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.24,0:27:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And friendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.04,0:27:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,as close as two friends can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.33,0:27:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come join this song, lay hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.85,0:27:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up your feet, raise your voice, and come join this song, lay hee!
